        "innocentReading": "Nothing here is concealed and nothing needs explaining. Maruti began in 1982 as a Government of India–Suzuki JV. SMC became the majority owner in 2002, and its stake rose over time through ordinary corporate actions. The largest step, 56.48% to 58.19% in Dec 2023, matches the preferential allotment to SMC in the Suzuki Motor Gujarat buyout. The smaller rises in 2026 fit further SMC purchases or allotments. This is a foreign strategic promoter stake, legally disclosed each quarter under SEBI LODR Reg. 31.",
